// Sheet: persistent, mobile control zone -- bludgeoning damage + push +
// blind/difficult-terrain dust cloud, roams the battlefield each round. The
// primary described effect (damage + knockback, "battering... and flinging
// them aside") is a single-strike combo GroundAoe already delivers natively
// (`damage`/`poise`/`knockback` are all first-class fields, see
// hemomancy/bloodboil.ron), so this ships as a one-shot burst -- same
// simplification already accepted for axiomancy/dark_star.ron and
// axiomancy/gravity_sinkhole.ron, both of which also describe a
// lingering/mobile zone in their sheet notes and ship as one-shot bursts.
// The secondary dust-cloud rider (push/blind & difficult terrain) has no
// periodic-knockback primitive to express it -- `StaticAura`'s aura list is
// buff-only, and no `BuffKind` reapplies a knockback -- so it's dropped
// rather than half-modeled. `GroundAoe`'s damage strike is hardcoded to
// `DamageKind::Energy` (see create_bonfire.ron's own note) -- the sheet's
// Bludgeoning damage_type is flavor-only here, the same pre-existing gap
// every GroundAoe spell in this pipeline ships with.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 78.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    delay: 0.45,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    max_range: 18.0,
    radius: 3.0,
    min_falloff: 0.4,
    damage: 20.0,
    poise: 15.0,
    knockback: (strength: 10.0, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: Some(White),
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Primordial)),
)
